'''Hallow's Edge''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2016 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2016|2016 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is white in the shape of a cutlass with spiky brown thorns going along the spine. The guard is made out of an orange pumpkin with four orange horns and a demonic face imprinted on it in black. Green pumpkin vines protrude out from behind the pumpkin. The handle is orange in color with the bottom of it being curled.

== Trivia ==
* There are [[Red Hallow|red]], [[Bronze Hallow|bronze]], [[Silver Hallow|silver]], and [[Golden Hallow|gold]] reskin versions of this knife, which were released as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] trophies.
* It has a reskin under the name [[Hallow's Blade]] from the [[Halloween Event 2017]].
* It is the prime of [[Hallow's Blade]], which is the magenta variant of this knife.
* Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/181356054/All-Hallows-Sword All Hallow's Sword].
* It was the first unboxable Halloween godly to be released in [[Murder Mystery 2]].
*During the [[Halloween Event 2017]], the statue of [[Nikilis]] in the main lobby was holding this knife.
*During the release of Hallow's edge, there was a glitch in [[Assassin]] mode where if you stabbed the wrong target you receive multiple Hallow's edge in your toolbox, it is unknown whether this was patched in 2017.

